#Wheel drawing: zodiac sign glyph scale and the alpha of each painted layer.
#The sign colours are built in CIELAB LCh (element = hue, modality =
#lightness tier, chroma fitted to the sRGB gamut), so the sector tints share
#a perceptual weight and the alpha below is what keeps aspect lines and
#cusps readable through them. Glyph alpha stays high: at ZODIAC_BG_ALPHA the
#worst glyph-on-sector contrast is 3.85:1 (WCAG AA for large text is 3.0).
